  <NAME>10X single-cell RNASeq profiling of tumor-infiltrating CD8+ T-cells from B16-OVA mouse melanoma tumors</NAME>
  <TITLE>10X single-cell RNASeq profiling of tumor-infiltrating CD8+ T-cells from B16-OVA mouse melanoma tumors</TITLE>
  <DESCRIPTION>Distinct populations of progenitor exhausted (Tcf1+Tim-3-) and terminally exhausted (Tcf1-Tim-3+) CD8+ T-cells occur in B16-OVA tumors Overall design: Profiling of CD8+ T-cells from day 10 and day 20 B16-OVA mouse melanoma tumors</DESCRIPTION>
